abstract: >-
  Prototype spatial and economic analysis of agricultural carbon-credit
  practices with adaptation co-benefits for Kenya, Ethiopia and Nigeria,
  and an exploratory comparison of avoided-loss formulations on Africa
  Agriculture Adaptation Atlas hazard data. Code is MIT; data and outputs
  are CC BY 4.0 unless an input's own licence says otherwise.
